  "body": "Based on `upstream/main` `6349a542e` (`v0.23.0`).\n\n## What changed\n- Added `AreaCtx::outside_clearing_stock` and updated `reach_past_edge` and `resolve` in `crates/app/src/operation/boundary.rs` so closed clearing operations (`Family::Clearing`) with `Containment::Outside` and setup stock expand to `stock.offset(2.0 * r)` minus holes and islands.\n- Guarded enclosed pockets in `reach_past_edge` with a `1e-2` mm rim check so pockets completely enclosed by part walls stay inside their walls instead of jumping to stock.\n- Added `non_sliver_center` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs` and called it from `pocket_entered` and `adaptive_trochoidal_with` (`crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch.rs`) to decompose pinched Clipper offset loops and drop sub-tolerance (`<= 0.01 mm^2` area and `<= 0.008 mm` half-width) slivers.\n- Added `name_outside_entry_refusal` in `crates/app/src/operation/generate/run_job.rs` to name `Extension (Boundary)` and setup stock when `Outside` clearing fails for lack of room or missing entry.\n- Updated `crates/app/tests/shoulder_adaptive.rs` and recorded the architectural decision in `docs/decisions/2232-adaptive-outside-stock.md`.\n\n## Cause\n`reach_past_edge` grew closed clearing selections by `2 * r` even when setup stock surrounded the part. That left a cutter-center width of zero or sub-tolerance Clipper chord slivers after `-r` erosion, so `2D Adaptive` failed with `the center area has no room for an entry` or emitted empty-move toolpaths on curved or flush corners.\n\n## Tests\n- Red on unchanged `upstream/main` `6349a54`: all 5 pinned tests failed (`containment_outside_clears_past_the_edge_never_the_recess`, `outside_containment_without_stock_refuses_naming_extension`, `fig8_bottom_face_outside_containment_generates_and_stops_at_face`, `outside_containment_air_band_fixture_blocks_post`, `outside_containment_clearing_kinds_and_enclosed_pockets`).\n- Mutation 1 (`stock_reach = None` in `boundary.rs`): `fig8_bottom_face_outside_containment_generates_and_stops_at_face` failed (RED), passed after restoring `boundary.rs` (GREEN).\n- Mutation 2 (removed `rim` enclosed-pocket guard in `boundary.rs`): `outside_containment_clearing_kinds_and_enclosed_pockets` failed (RED), passed after restoring `boundary.rs` (GREEN).\n- Mutation 3 (reverted `run_job.rs` to `upstream/main`): `outside_containment_without_stock_refuses_naming_extension` failed (RED), passed after restoring `run_job.rs` (GREEN).\n- Mutation 4 (`non_sliver_center` replaced by `region.offset(-erode)?` in `pocket.rs`): `outside_containment_without_stock_refuses_naming_extension` failed on flush stock with an empty toolpath (RED), passed after restoring `pocket.rs` (GREEN).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`116 step(s), 0 failed`, `wall 41.4 min`, including `shoulder_adaptive` in `52s`).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed with 0 warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` returned empty). The pinned refusal `containment_outside_clears_past_the_edge_never_the_recess` in `crates/app/tests/shoulder_adaptive.rs` now asserts a generated toolpath under setup stock, while the no-stock `extension: 4.0` check moves to `containment_outside_without_stock_clears_with_extension_never_the_recess`.\n\n## Not exercised\n- No real CNC machine or controller run was made.\n- Suites outside the 116-step quick gate were not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n`crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs` is also modified by open PR #2149 (`PocketParams::validate`) and open PR #2035 (`pocket_over`). This change adds `non_sliver_center` and updates only `pocket_entered`; whichever PR merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: Clearing operations with Outside containment now clear from setup stock to the selected face or edge instead of failing on a one-tool band.\nFixes #2232\n",
